<title>USA: OHM Corp names Philip Strawbridge CFO.</title>
<headline>OHM Corp names Philip Strawbridge CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FINDLAY, Ohio 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>OHM Corp said it named Philip Strawbridge as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Strawbridge joined OHM in February, serving as vice president and chief administrative officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Harold Ingalls, who resigned in April to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
